!! _POC-XRL2VPN XR03(PE・XRd・RT01 の先)= コアの IS-IS と LDP だけ。XRd が L2VPN を転送するかを CE3 で見る。
interface Loopback0
 ipv4 address 10.255.0.31 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[3] }}
 description CORE to RT01
 ipv4 address 10.0.31.31 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[4] }}
 description CE3
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 is-type level-2-only
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0031.00
 log adjacency changes
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  metric-style wide
 !
 interface Loopback0
  passive
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
   metric 10
   mpls ldp sync
  !
 !
!
mpls oam
!
mpls ldp
 interface {{ links[3] }}
 !
!
end
